# Red-team / pentest reference notes. The installer already strips this
# directory after copy (antivirus false positives). Shipping it in the
# tarball is what npm's 2026-07-28 publish-time scanner holds as dual-use
# malware — 3.6.5 and 3.6.6 both PUT 202 then never became GET-able.
# The files stay in git; users who want them copy from the GitHub repo.
